      "id": "claim_c1ceff5d6c5d4e22aa8b16a8ce787305",
      "statement": "Every LangChain component—prompts, models, parsers, retrievers, tools—implements the Runnable interface, providing unified invoke, ainvoke, batch, abatch, stream, and astream methods. This unified interface enables declarative composition without custom adapter code.",
