    {
      "id": "claim_19edca10e9d74676beef229119b89a16",
      "statement": "RunnableSequence preserves streaming properties: if all steps implement transform, the sequence chains them end-to-end for progressive streaming. If any step lacks transform, streaming begins after that step. This enables responsive output without redundant buffering.",
