      "id": "claim_06675c49bfc2426db6d098948f12c01e",
      "statement": "RunnableConfig (tags, metadata, callbacks, max_concurrency, configurable fields) is threaded through composed chains automatically. Configs are merged at composition boundaries, with child values taking precedence and list fields accumulating. Context variables propagate config down the call stack.",
