          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4afaa6ff7a5caba1f848a15f6bded7f8eea19b03411a6549bca2fae7c2dafe54:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_02fd606ec145401094f412537792acb3",
      "statement": "Each agent maintains its own isolated AgentState (messages, jump_to, custom fields). State does not automatically flow between parent and child agents. To share context across hierarchy levels, pass relevant state through tool function inputs, include context in system prompts, or use runtime.context (if provided by the application). Persistent shared state requires Store integration.",
